# Database Administration Labs

A collection of hands-on database administration labs completed as part of my
CIT3013 Database Administration coursework.

## Overview

These labs demonstrate practical experience with database administration,
SQL, security, user management, access control, and database operations.

## Technologies & Skills

- Oracle Database
- SQL / PL/SQL
- Database Administration
- User and Role Management
- Access Control
- Privileges and Permissions
- Database Security
- Database Troubleshooting
